Wait, `SetUserPassword` for default calls `findRedisUser` -> `listRedisUsers`; default has `nopass`, no helper secret; `redisExec` direct ACL LIST; then `requireActive`, `EnableRedisACLFile` (config no aclfile -> ACL LIST direct, write, restart), then password command. The `joined` calls include `ACL LIST` (argv) but no `-acl`/`-@admin`; `ACL SAVE` argv. The `-@admin`/`-@dangerous` may appear in the ACL LIST output? The fake output is returned, not in argv. Good. `+@read` not in argv. Good.
