Current function lines 436-543. New:

```go
func (c *DockerServiceController) ImportDatabase(...) (model.DatabaseJob, error) {
    engine, engineID, err := ...
    ...
    requireActive
    exists...
    if !exists -> ErrNotFound
    staging...
