```
- For `ImportMerge` with `PreImportBackup`, preBackupID set; success job BackupID set. Good.
- For `ImportReplace`, forced.
- For corrupt gzip, `openSQLFile`/validate fails before pre-op backup/drop.
- For malformed SQL, runEngineInput fails after drop; failed job with preBackupID.
- `filename` unused; fine.
- Note `exists` always true after check; no need `if exists`.
- `mode == replace` drop existing; if drop fails, failed job.
- `preBackupID` for merge with no pre-op is empty; failed job BackupID empty.

