    if err := engine.ValidateDatabaseName... 
    ...
}
```
Change current to `if !isGrantableScope(engine, grant.Database) || protected`.
Desired: after global check, `if strings.Contains(grant.Database,"%") { return invalidIdentifier(dbengine.ErrInvalidIdentifier) }`; `ValidateDatabaseName`; protected.
